<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title || 'TechEnglish - Học Tiếng Anh Chuyên Ngành CNTT' %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    .mvc-badge-bar {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #2563eb, #10b981);
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }
    .mvc-nav-link {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #334155;
      font-size: 14px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      transition: all 0.2s;
    }
    .mvc-nav-link:hover {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      color: #2563eb;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="mvc-badge-bar">
    <i class="fas fa-cubes"></i> <strong>Mô Hình MVC Tam Giác:</strong> Controller điều khiển &rarr; Model xử lý dữ liệu &rarr; Model đổ dữ liệu trực tiếp vào View
  </div>

  <header class="navbar" style="background: #fff; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;">
